{"about_the_game":"Join the Y0L0 Space Hacker Agency, an ethical hacker organisation.<br>Your first mission: hack into a space station and unravel its mystery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Happened On Bikini-72? </h2>   - Explore a 3d Adventure Game<br>   - Solve puzzles based on real security breaches<br>   - Crack passwords<br>   - Intercept and temper with web requests<br>   - Get passed servers security<br>   - All of this in a secure environment to learn and improve your skills<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real hacking tools</h2>Use the hacker tools integrated into the game: a terminal, a web proxy, nmap to scan the network, dirb for brute-force attacks on websites, password lists to force authentication, John to crack passwords, reverse shells, privilege escalation techniques...<br><br>Once the flaw is found, run a Reverse Shell and get Admin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where to start?</h2>- You know nothing about cybersecurity? That's fine, we're set to tell you everything you need to know! <br>We have prepared a comprehensive Cyber-security tutorial for beginners. <br>Complete missions, to learn step by step the various techniques used by hackers. You'll probably have to use your brain a little bit, but you'll never get stuck.<br><br>- You already know the basics of Linux machines and a bit of programming? That's great, it's going to get really interesting!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"87fa4bb5cd21902e357775eb6507fd4668633e2d.jpg","localized_name":"First Flag","name":"First Flag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1341450/87fa4bb5cd21902e357775eb6507fd4668633e2d.jpg"},{"icon":"692b14463360b770eb2a8f6285a0a3d0e9742ce8.jpg","localized_name":"John the ripper","name":"John the ripper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1341450/692b14463360b770eb2a8f6285a0a3d0e9742ce8.jpg"},{"icon":"692b14463360b770eb2a8f6285a0a3d0e9742ce8.jpg","localized_name":"Rock you","name":"Rock you","path":"http